        passageEn:
            "Their teacher handed out a mysterious map of the school grounds with tiny pictures scattered across it, but no words explaining what any of them meant. \"How are we supposed to know what these mean?\" Zaw Zaw asked, staring at a small green triangle and a blue wavy line.\n\n"
            "\"Look in the corner,\" said Nay Chi, pointing to a small box at the bottom of the map. \"This must be the map key. It says the green triangle means a tree, and the blue wavy line means the school's small pond.\" The three friends checked the key against every symbol on the map.\n\n"
