      xpReward: 10,
      readingPassage: ReadingPassageModel(
        titleEn: "The New Classmate",
        titleMy: "အတန်းဖော်အသစ်",
        passageEn:
            "A new student named Nok joined Moe Moe, Nay Chi, and Zaw Zaw's class after her family moved from Thailand. At lunchtime, Zaw Zaw noticed Nok eating a dish he had never seen before.\n\n"
            "\"What's that?\" he asked curiously, careful to sound interested rather than judgmental. \"It's a Thai dish my mother made,\" Nok explained, smiling as she offered him a small taste. Zaw Zaw tried it and found he really liked the new flavors.\n\n"
            "Later, another student made a joke, saying Nok's country only ate strange food. Nay Chi spoke up kindly but firmly. \"That's not fair. Every country has many different foods, and it's not right to judge a whole country based on one dish.\" The other student thought about it and apologized.\n\n"
            "By the end of the week, Nok had taught the class several Thai words, and the class had taught her some Burmese phrases in return. \"Learning about each other's countries makes us all richer,\" their teacher said, proud of how respectfully the class had welcomed their new friend.",
        passageMy:
            "Nok ဟု အမည်ရှိသော ကျောင်းသူအသစ်တစ်ဦးသည် ၎င်း၏မိသားစု ထိုင်းနိုင်ငံမှ ပြောင်းရွှေ့ပြီးနောက် မိုးမိုး၊ နေချည်နှင့် ဇော်ဇော်တို့၏ အတန်းသို့ ဝင်ရောက်ခဲ့သည်။ နေ့လယ်စာချိန်တွင် ဇော်ဇော်သည် Nok ယခင်က တစ်ခါမျှ မမြင်ဖူးသော ဟင်းလျာတစ်ခု စားနေသည်ကို တွေ့ခဲ့သည်။\n\n"
