        passageEn:
            "Zaw Zaw wanted to send a thoughtful gift to Sai, his pen pal's cousin who lived in Thailand, one of Myanmar's neighbouring countries. \"I need to save some money first,\" he decided, remembering their lessons about needs, wants, and saving.\n\n"
            "He saved a little each week instead of spending it all on snacks, just like he had for his bicycle. Once he had enough, he visited the market and used a hand-drawn map to find a small shop that sold handmade crafts.\n\n"
